            <ArticleTitle>Assessing for risk and progression of osteoarthritis: the nurse's role.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S26-31</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/01.NAJ.0000412648.25797.f0</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors review the primary and secondary risk factors for osteoarthritis (OA), its pathophysiology and epidemiology, the evidence-based approaches to slowing progression, and the role of nurses encountering OA in primary care and other settings.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
